# Pipeline API keys (Python, offline pipeline). NOT the app's keys -- those are in .env.example.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.pipeline` (gitignored, never committed) and fill in the values,
# or export the same names as environment variables (the environment wins).
# Instructions per key: docs/PIPELINE.md, section "API keys".

# Elsevier Article Retrieval API: full text of Elsevier articles (incl. AJCN, J Nutr).
# Get one at https://dev.elsevier.com ("I want an API key"), registered to the COMPANY
# account, and ask Elsevier to enable full-text (text and data mining) access for it.
# A key that is valid but not enabled makes the run print
# "ELSEVIER: the key is valid but not enabled for full text".
ELSEVIER_API_KEY=
